  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F-150 crew Cab\n2017-2026 Ford F-250 F-350 supercrew cab\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2015-2026 Ford F-150 crew Cab, 2017-2026 Ford F-250 F-350 supercrew cab; Confirm the product is compatible with your vehicle before purchase\nUnmatched Strength: YITAMOTOR running board is crafted from high-strength stainless steel for exceptional corrosion & rust resistance, stability and long-term durability; Each side can handle up to 500lb to offer reliable support for all users\nVersatile Functionality: Our 6-inch wide step bars provide convenient access with generous stepping space; Special style better suits your truck and can adapt well to enhance the aesthetics of the body\nEnhanced Durability: YITAMOTOR nerf bars feature a textured powder coating for enhanced rust resistance and an aggressive appearance; The bump design further improves slip resistance, ensuring both durability and style for your truck\nHassle-Free Installation: No drilling or cutting required; The slider is designed for position adjustments back and forth on the vehicle for a smoother installation\nProfessional installation recommended",
